      "text": "Fundamentals\nhttps://learning-oreilly-com.opl.idm.oclc.org/library/view/fundamentals-of-software/9781098143220/\nhttps://learning-oreilly-com.opl.idm.oclc.org/library/view/learning-python-6th/9781098171292/\n\n\nlower level\nhttps://learning-oreilly-com.opl.idm.oclc.org/library/view/high-performance-python/9781492055013/ix01.html\nhttps://learning-oreilly-com.opl.idm.oclc.org/library/view/python-concurrency-with/9781617298660/\n\noptional\nhttps://learning-oreilly-com.opl.idm.oclc.org/library/view/robust-python/9781098100650/\nhttps://learning-oreilly-com.opl.idm.oclc.org/library/view/pythonic-programming/9781680509199/\n\ndesign patterns\nhttps://learning-oreilly-com.opl.idm.oclc.org/library/view/architecture-patterns-with/9781492052197/\n\n\nsystem design\nhttps://learning-oreilly-com.opl.idm.oclc.org/library/view/designing-data-intensive-applications/9781098119058/\nhttps://learning-oreilly-com.opl.idm.oclc.org/library/view/designing-distributed-systems/9781098156343/\n\n\nlearning kubernetes\nhttps://learning-oreilly-com.opl.idm.oclc.org/library/view/kubernetes-up-and/9781098110192/\nhttps://learning-oreilly-com.opl.idm.oclc.org/library/view/production-kubernetes/9781492092292/\n\nkubernetes lower level\nhttps://learning-oreilly-com.opl.idm.oclc.org/library/view/programming-kubernetes/9781492047094/\n\n\nkubernetes design patterns\nhttps://learning-oreilly-com.opl.idm.oclc.org/library/view/kubernetes-patterns-2nd/9781098131678/\n",
