      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AWS GLUE (CPU Spark) -> SAGEMAKER (GPU/TPU) -> Cloudwatch+Prometheus+Grafana \n\nSagemaker abstracts on EC2\nECR to register containers on EKS (AWS Kubernetes) for multiple servers, ECS (AWS docker) for multiple containers on 1 server",
