      "updated": 1787190515856,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Youtube data pipeline:\n 1. record video -> upload the video -> video is processed -> gemini encodes -> \"ask AI\" to get transcript/subtitles/text \n\n2. record video + realtime transcription (voice-to-text) -> video is processed + transcripts and timestamps (title, body, hashtags; takeaways)\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Youtube data pipeline:\n 1. record video -> upload the video -> video is processed -> gemini encodes -> \"ask AI\" to get transcript/subtitles/text \n\n2. record video + realtime transcription (voice-to-text) -> video is processed + transcripts and timestamps (title, body, hashtags; takeaways)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
